@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Digital Watch

state StartWatch
state HourAdjustment
state MinuteAdjustment
state AlarmHourAdjustment
state AlarmMinuteAdjustment
state AlarmOn[*]
state AlarmOff
state LightOn[*]
state LightOff
state CurrentTime

StartWatch:!
CurrentTime: StartWatch: Set Initial Time
AlarmOn[*]: CurrentTime: Alarm Enabled
AlarmOff: AlarmOn[*]: Alarm Disabled
LightOn[*]: CurrentTime: Light On
LightOff: LightOn[*]: Light Off

HourAdjustment: AlarmOn[*] : Adjust Hour
MinuteAdjustment: AlarmOn[*] : Adjust Minutes
AlarmHourAdjustment: AlarmOff: Adjust Alarm Hour
AlarmMinuteAdjustment: AlarmOff: Adjust Alarm Minutes

@enduml
